# Runtime state from install.sh/setup.sh normally lands outside the repo
# ($HOME/.claude, $HOME/.local/share) -- these guard against a repo-relative
# CLAUDE_HOOKS_DIR/CLAUDE_SETTINGS test run (the README documents both as
# env overrides) landing generated files, a local backend URL, or a signing
# key inside the tracked tree.
